## 7. How to Run the Project

The project notebook is designed to run using Google Colab.

1. Open the notebook using the Google Colab link.
2. Connect your Google Drive.
3. Configure Kaggle API authentication securely using Colab Secrets or environment variables.
4. Install the required Python libraries.
5. Execute the notebook cells sequentially.
6. Allow the notebook to download and extract the dataset.
7. Run the profiling, cleaning and warehouse creation stages.
8. Execute SQL analytics and generate business intelligence reports.
9. Run the customer retention modelling pipeline.
10. Review the generated analytical reports and model evaluation results.

**Open in Google Colab:**

[![Open In Colab](https://colab.research.google.com/assets/colab-badge.svg)](https://colab.research.google.com/github/Nitisha-27/InsightFlowAI/blob/main/InsightFlowAI.ipynb)

